# Actor kind $58 ($83:DBBB, its wait $83:DC9B), the rising and sinking
# platforms of stage a3 s0 (level 8; records $0BAB, $0BFB, $0CEB at x
# $03A0, $0360, $03E0, and $0D8B), which no other script reaches. The view
# put at x $03C0, y 0. Aladdin dropped onto $0BAB: he rides it ($43 set,
# pose 1). Moved onto $0BFB: $0BAB's copier count ($42) runs out and its
# test finds no copier. Held in the air under $0CEB at its top for 30
# frames: he hangs from it ($44 counts, pose 4 by his flip); $1427
# cleared: he lets go ($44 from $F0). With cartram on he rides $0BAB
# again and moves to $0BFB: its test finds the copier and puts him on
# $0BAB. Then $0D8B restarted (state $0C) with $07 = $12, its bit 4
# variant (pose 3); $0BAB's bit 6 of $09 set, and the view moved to x
# $07D0, where level 8's kind $58 ends unless that bit is set. Last,
# health 0: each one takes pose $FF.
load build/aladdin/states/stage_a3_s0.state
wait 30
poke 001773 C0,03
poke 0019E5 C0,03
poke 001777 00,00
poke 0019E9 00,00
poke 0008E7 00,04
poke 0008EA 60,00
wait 20
poke 0008E7 A0,03
poke 0008EA 30,00
wait 100
poke 0008E7 60,03
wait 90
repeat 30
poke 0008E7 E0,03
poke 0008EA 52,00
wait 1
end
wait 60
poke 001427 00
wait 40
cartram on
poke 0008E7 A0,03
poke 0008EA 30,00
wait 80
poke 0008E7 60,03
wait 60
cartram off
wait 10
poke 000D8B 0C
poke 000D92 12
wait 60
poke 000BB4 D0
poke 001773 D0,07
poke 0019E5 D0,07
wait 30
poke 000367 00
wait 20
